    "market_commentary": "The SSY Pacific Capesize Index fell for the third week in a row, down 126 points to 4,960 points week-on-week. SSY’s assessed W.Australia-China iron ore spot voyage rate went down $0.25/t to $7.80, while the round-voyage rate declined $900/day to $12,250/day.",
